<title>CHINA: China Jan-Aug zinc exports rise 4.7 percent yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Aug zinc exports rise 4.7 percent yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought zinc and zinc alloys rose to 134,495 tonnes in the first eight months of 1996, up 4.7 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Zinc exports were 17,202 tonnes in August.</p>
<p>China exported a total of 128,392 tonnes of zinc in the first eight months of 1995, customs figures showed.</p>
</text>
